{"v":1,"accession":"PRJNA576374","title":"Microbiomes of trombiculid mites. Raw sequence reads.","description":"The microbiome of trombiculid mites (chiggers), the vectors of scrub typhus, in the natural environment is largely unknown. The microbiome may impact on vector competence as in other systems, such as mosquitoes. These data represent microbiomes for individual wild chigger specimens from Thailand, from pools of the same species from different Thai provinces, and pools of multiple species from the same province.","center":"University of Liverpool","data_type":"Raw sequence reads","submission_date":"2019/10/08 00:00","sample_cols":["accession","title","tier","context","collection_date","collection_year","country","region","place_id","place","location_status","lat","lon","submitted_location","isolation_source","env_broad_scale","env_local_scale","env_medium","eligibility_reason"],"samples":[["SAMN13016825","Metagenome or environmental sample from indoor metagenome","uncertain",null,null,2016,null,null,null,null,"unresolved",null,null,null,"background control in the lab (reagent and water in contact with equipment)",null,null,null,"environmental sample; urban association not established"]],"run_cols":["accession","sample","experiment","assay","strategy","source","layout","platform","instrument","bases","spots","release_date","download_url"],"runs":[["SRR10269227","SAMN13016825","SRX6982649","16S","AMPLICON","GENOMIC","PAIRED","ILLUMINA","Illumina MiSeq",3052548,8744,"2019-10-11","https://sra-downloadb.be-md.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/sos9/sra-pub-zq-922/SRR010/269/SRR10269227.sralite.1"],["SRR10269228","SAMN13016825","SRX6982648","16S","AMPLICON","GENOMIC","PAIRED","ILLUMINA","Illumina MiSeq",2421603,7123,"2019-10-11","https://sra-downloadb.be-md.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/sos9/sra-pub-zq-922/SRR010/269/SRR10269228.sralite.1"],["SRR10269229","SAMN13016825","SRX6982647","16S","AMPLICON","GENOMIC","PAIRED","ILLUMINA","Illumina MiSeq",36093091,82882,"2019-10-11","https://sra-download